  "task": {
    "objective": "Move finite cargo to own destination while choosing cash expenditure, safer spatial routes, protection, escort, repairs and credible collateralized cover.",
    "natural_termination": "Natural completion when every cargo is delivered or destroyed. Each cargo outcome is retained separately; joint termination need not mean success. H=64 otherwise; unexpired pacts at truncation remain recorded with collateral locked.",
    "interaction": "Nearby offers require peer acceptance and reserve actual coins from both agents. Later spatial hazard damage transfers the pooled collateral, delivery/expiry refunds it, escort reduces peer damage, and a nearby repair spends actor cash on peer cargo.",
    "observation_access": "Fully observable native map, positions, hazards/phases, health, cash, offers, pacts, timers, delivery/destruction status and events. There is no hidden risk state in this design. Role-specific masks still suppress inactive entity drawing; their final positions/outcomes are observed."
